    modified_response: "I will now create the `/src/components/FirmwareGenerator.tsx` file. This component dynamically assembles three major files required to compile and flash the physical ESP32-S3 POV display: `platformio.ini`, `main.cpp`, `rendering_engine.h`, and a dynamic `image_data.h` which contains actual downsampled Cartesian-to-Polar nested matrices matching any image uploaded to or generated in the simulator workspace! This allows users to export code directly to their hardware."
