        lines {
          text: "                <strong className=\"text-slate-300\">Ground Isolation:</strong> Use star connection geometries. The brushless motor ESC generates high-frequency back-EMF feedback. Do NOT share the delicate ESP32 analog pins ground trace directly from the motor feed lines; isolate via optocouplers or 0-ohm jumper ferrites at PCB origin."
