          text: "                $$T_{\'{sector}\'} = \\frac{\'{T_{\\\\text{rev}}}\'}{\'{N \\\\text{ slices}\'}} = \\frac{\'{60 \\\\cdot 10^6}\'}{\'{\\\\text{RPM} \\\\cdot N}\'}$$"
