          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            A dual-arm rotor spinning at 1200 RPM and 20cm length moves its tip at nearly <strong>90 km/h</strong>. Under <strong>1,610 G\'s of centrifugal pressure</strong>, any asymmetrical mass distributions creates deep lateral torque stress, leading to high-frequency structural vibration, sound pollution, motor bearing wear, and eventual joint rupture."
