  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Hardware / Specialist Tool\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Hardware / Specialist Tool\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"bg-[#0B0C0E] text-[#E0E2E5] h-[768px] w-[1024px] flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Section -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 border-b border-[#2A2D33] flex items-center justify-between px-6 bg-[#15171A]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-[#00F0FF] rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[#000] font-black text-xs\\\">POV</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#00F0FF]\\\">AERO-SYNC CORE v4.2</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">ESP32-S3 // DUAL-CORE // DMA-OPTIMIZED</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    \\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#00F0FF] shadow-[0_0_8px_#00F0FF]\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase\\\">WebSocket: Connected</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-end\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">IP: 192.168.4.1</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">RSSI: -42dBm</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Control Interface -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-0\\\">\\n    \\n    <!-- Left Sidebar: Controls -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"col-span-3 border-r border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#0E1012] p-6 flex flex-col space-y-8\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-[#8E9299] mb-4 border-l-2 border-[#00F0FF] pl-2\\\">Actuators</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-6\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono\\\">\\n              <span>TARGET RPM</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[#00F0FF]\\\">1,250</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-1 bg-[#1A1D21] rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-3/4 h-full bg-[#00F0FF]\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono\\\">\\n              <span>BRIGHTNESS</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[#00F0FF]\\\">85%</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-1 bg-[#1A1D21] rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-4/5 h-full bg-[#00F0FF]\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-[#8E9299] mb-4 border-l-2 border-[#8E9299] pl-2\\\">Display Modes</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"bg-[#1A1D21] border border-[#2A2D33] text-[10px] py-3 px-4 text-left font-mono hover:bg-[#2A2D33] flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span>01 // STATIC IMAGE</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"opacity-30\\\">OFF</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"bg-[#00F0FF] border border-[#00F0FF] text-[10px] py-3 px-4 text-left font-mono text-[#000] font-bold flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span>02 // VIDEO STREAM</span>\\n            <span>ACTIVE</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"bg-[#1A1D21] border border-[#2A2D33] text-[10px] py-3 px-4 text-left font-mono hover:bg-[#2A2D33] flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span>03 // VOLUMETRIC CLOCK</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"opacity-30\\\">OFF</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"w-full bg-[#FF4E00] text-[#000] font-black text-xs py-4 uppercase tracking-tighter shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,78,0,0.3)] hover:brightness-110\\\">\\n          Emergency System Halt\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Center: Simulator View -->\\n    <section class=\\\"col-span-6 bg-[#000] relative flex items-center justify-center border-r border-[#2A2D33] overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <!-- Grid Overlay -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#00F0FF 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;\\\"></div>\\n      \\n      <!-- POV Visualizer Circle -->\\n      <div class=\\\"relative w-[500px] h-[500px] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <!-- Outer Housing Border -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 border border-[#2A2D33] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <!-- Rotation Tracks -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-8 border border-dashed border-[#1A1D21] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-20 border border-dashed border-[#1A1D21] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        \\n        <!-- The Hologram Effect (Simulation) -->\\n        <div class=\\\"relative w-[380px] h-[380px] rounded-full overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center group\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#00F0FF]/10 to-transparent animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center z-10\\\">\\n                <h1 class=\\\"text-[#00F0FF] text-4xl font-black italic tracking-tighter leading-none\\\">AERO<br>SYNC</h1>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono mt-4 text-[#00F0FF] tracking-widest opacity-80 uppercase\\\">Buffer stream active // 60 FPS</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <!-- Blade Simulation Lines -->\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute w-full h-[1px] bg-[#00F0FF]/40 blur-sm rotate-[120deg]\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute w-full h-[1px] bg-[#00F0FF]/40 blur-sm rotate-[300deg]\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Angular Metadata Labels -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-6 text-[9px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">0\302\260 / 360\302\260</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 translate-x-10 -translate-y-1/2 text-[9px] font-mono text-[#8E9299] rotate-90\\\">90\302\260</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-6 text-[9px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">180\302\260</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-x-10 -translate-y-1/2 text-[9px] font-mono text-[#8E9299] -rotate-90\\\">270\302\260</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Simulation Info HUD -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-8 left-8 border-l border-[#00F0FF] pl-4 py-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\\\">Sync Jitter</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-lg font-mono font-bold\\\">0.042<span class=\\\"text-[10px] opacity-40 ml-1\\\">MS</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 text-right border-r border-[#00F0FF] pr-4 py-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\\\">Hall Sync</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-lg font-mono font-bold\\\">LOCKED</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Sidebar: Diagnostics -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"col-span-3 bg-[#0E1012] p-6 flex flex-col space-y-6\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-[#8E9299] mb-4\\\">Telemetry</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-[#1A1D21] pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">MCU TEMP</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-sm font-mono\\\">48.2\302\260C</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-[#1A1D21] pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">HEAP FREE</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-sm font-mono\\\">184 KB</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-[#1A1D21] pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">I2S BUFFER</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-sm font-mono\\\">12.5%</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-[#1A1D21] pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">LED CURRENT</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-sm font-mono text-[#FFB800]\\\">4.82A</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-[#8E9299] mb-4\\\">Storage // LittleFS</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-2 bg-[#1A1D21] rounded-sm text-[10px] font-mono border border-[#2A2D33]\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"truncate w-32\\\">anim_cyber_v2.bin</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#8E9299]\\\">1.2MB</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-2 bg-[#1A1D21] rounded-sm text-[10px] font-mono border border-[#2A2D33]\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"truncate w-32\\\">logo_rotation.gif</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#8E9299]\\\">420KB</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-2 bg-[#2A2D33] rounded-sm text-[10px] font-mono border border-[#00F0FF] shadow-[inset_0_0_10px_rgba(0,240,255,0.1)]\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"truncate w-32\\\">main_video.mjpeg</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#00F0FF]\\\">ACTIVE</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-4 border-2 border-dashed border-[#1A1D21] h-24 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#8E9299] uppercase\\\">Drop media to upload</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[9px] text-[#4F555E]\\\">Limit: 16MB per file</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </aside>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer: System Log -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-12 bg-[#000] border-t border-[#2A2D33] px-6 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[9px] font-mono py-1 px-2 bg-[#1A1D21] text-[#00F0FF] rounded-sm\\\">LOG</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">[12:44:02] Frame synchronization re-aligned. Jitter minimized.</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#4F555E]\\\">\\n      v4.2.0-STABLE | BUILD: 20231027-14\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Hardware / Specialist Tool\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Hardware / Specialist Tool\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"bg-[#0B0C0E] text-[#E0E2E5] h-[768px] w-[1024px] flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Section -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 border-b border-[#2A2D33] flex items-center justify-between px-6 bg-[#15171A]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-[#00F0FF] rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[#000] font-black text-xs\\\">POV</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#00F0FF]\\\">AERO-SYNC CORE v4.2</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">ESP32-S3 // DUAL-CORE // DMA-OPTIMIZED</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    \\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#00F0FF] shadow-[0_0_8px_#00F0FF]\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase\\\">WebSocket: Connected</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-end\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">IP: 192.168.4.1</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">RSSI: -42dBm</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Control Interface -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-0\\\">\\n    \\n    <!-- Left Sidebar: Controls -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"col-span-3 border-r border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#0E1012] p-6 flex flex-col space-y-8\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-[#8E9299] mb-4 border-l-2 border-[#00F0FF] pl-2\\\">Actuators</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-6\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono\\\">\\n              <span>TARGET RPM</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[#00F0FF]\\\">1,250</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-1 bg-[#1A1D21] rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-3/4 h-full bg-[#00F0FF]\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono\\\">\\n              <span>BRIGHTNESS</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[#00F0FF]\\\">85%</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"h-1 bg-[#1A1D21] rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-4/5 h-full bg-[#00F0FF]\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-[#8E9299] mb-4 border-l-2 border-[#8E9299] pl-2\\\">Display Modes</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"bg-[#1A1D21] border border-[#2A2D33] text-[10px] py-3 px-4 text-left font-mono hover:bg-[#2A2D33] flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span>01 // STATIC IMAGE</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"opacity-30\\\">OFF</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"bg-[#00F0FF] border border-[#00F0FF] text-[10px] py-3 px-4 text-left font-mono text-[#000] font-bold flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span>02 // VIDEO STREAM</span>\\n            <span>ACTIVE</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"bg-[#1A1D21] border border-[#2A2D33] text-[10px] py-3 px-4 text-left font-mono hover:bg-[#2A2D33] flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span>03 // VOLUMETRIC CLOCK</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"opacity-30\\\">OFF</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"w-full bg-[#FF4E00] text-[#000] font-black text-xs py-4 uppercase tracking-tighter shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,78,0,0.3)] hover:brightness-110\\\">\\n          Emergency System Halt\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Center: Simulator View -->\\n    <section class=\\\"col-span-6 bg-[#000] relative flex items-center justify-center border-r border-[#2A2D33] overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <!-- Grid Overlay -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#00F0FF 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;\\\"></div>\\n      \\n      <!-- POV Visualizer Circle -->\\n      <div class=\\\"relative w-[500px] h-[500px] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <!-- Outer Housing Border -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 border border-[#2A2D33] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <!-- Rotation Tracks -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-8 border border-dashed border-[#1A1D21] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-20 border border-dashed border-[#1A1D21] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        \\n        <!-- The Hologram Effect (Simulation) -->\\n        <div class=\\\"relative w-[380px] h-[380px] rounded-full overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center group\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#00F0FF]/10 to-transparent animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-center z-10\\\">\\n                <h1 class=\\\"text-[#00F0FF] text-4xl font-black italic tracking-tighter leading-none\\\">AERO<br>SYNC</h1>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono mt-4 text-[#00F0FF] tracking-widest opacity-80 uppercase\\\">Buffer stream active // 60 FPS</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <!-- Blade Simulation Lines -->\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute w-full h-[1px] bg-[#00F0FF]/40 blur-sm rotate-[120deg]\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute w-full h-[1px] bg-[#00F0FF]/40 blur-sm rotate-[300deg]\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Angular Metadata Labels -->\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-6 text-[9px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">0\302\260 / 360\302\260</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 translate-x-10 -translate-y-1/2 text-[9px] font-mono text-[#8E9299] rotate-90\\\">90\302\260</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-6 text-[9px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">180\302\260</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-x-10 -translate-y-1/2 text-[9px] font-mono text-[#8E9299] -rotate-90\\\">270\302\260</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Simulation Info HUD -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-8 left-8 border-l border-[#00F0FF] pl-4 py-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\\\">Sync Jitter</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-lg font-mono font-bold\\\">0.042<span class=\\\"text-[10px] opacity-40 ml-1\\\">MS</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 text-right border-r border-[#00F0FF] pr-4 py-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\\\">Hall Sync</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-lg font-mono font-bold\\\">LOCKED</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Sidebar: Diagnostics -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"col-span-3 bg-[#0E1012] p-6 flex flex-col space-y-6\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-[#8E9299] mb-4\\\">Telemetry</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-[#1A1D21] pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">MCU TEMP</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-sm font-mono\\\">48.2\302\260C</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-[#1A1D21] pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">HEAP FREE</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-sm font-mono\\\">184 KB</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-[#1A1D21] pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">I2S BUFFER</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-sm font-mono\\\">12.5%</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-[#1A1D21] pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">LED CURRENT</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-sm font-mono text-[#FFB800]\\\">4.82A</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n        <h3 class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-[#8E9299] mb-4\\\">Storage // LittleFS</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-2 bg-[#1A1D21] rounded-sm text-[10px] font-mono border border-[#2A2D33]\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"truncate w-32\\\">anim_cyber_v2.bin</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#8E9299]\\\">1.2MB</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-2 bg-[#1A1D21] rounded-sm text-[10px] font-mono border border-[#2A2D33]\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"truncate w-32\\\">logo_rotation.gif</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#8E9299]\\\">420KB</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-2 bg-[#2A2D33] rounded-sm text-[10px] font-mono border border-[#00F0FF] shadow-[inset_0_0_10px_rgba(0,240,255,0.1)]\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"truncate w-32\\\">main_video.mjpeg</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#00F0FF]\\\">ACTIVE</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-4 border-2 border-dashed border-[#1A1D21] h-24 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#8E9299] uppercase\\\">Drop media to upload</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[9px] text-[#4F555E]\\\">Limit: 16MB per file</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </aside>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer: System Log -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-12 bg-[#000] border-t border-[#2A2D33] px-6 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[9px] font-mono py-1 px-2 bg-[#1A1D21] text-[#00F0FF] rounded-sm\\\">LOG</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8E9299]\\\">[12:44:02] Frame synchronization re-aligned. Jitter minimized.</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#4F555E]\\\">\\n      v4.2.0-STABLE | BUILD: 20231027-14\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
