I\'ll create the file directly.\n\n\n**Refining Workflow Details**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on configuring the `build-apk.yml` file, focusing on essential details like JDK and Gradle versions, typically JDK 17 for compatibility with Capacitor and Android builds, and an `ubuntu-latest` runner for a powerful environment. I\'m also considering additional files that might benefit from updates. I\'ve switched gears and am investigating integration with `DashboardControl.tsx` to enhance the user experience by visually integrating GitHub Actions, potentially through a button or visual element in the APK compilation panel or another prominent panel to make the workflow obvious to the user. My analysis of `src/components/DashboardControl.tsx` is ongoing.\n\n\n"
